      "message": "For consistency, this can be moved to ResourceProvider::findOrCreateComputePipeline.\n\nSide note: I think I like the pattern in this CL of using ResourceProvider to call setLabel, but an alternative could be that we just expect every subclass to call it in its ctor like you have here. As long as everything is consistent.",
